            "value" : "%llu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "~/Library/Logs/Sevoflurane-wine.log always records errors. This setting also records every exception and library load, so the log grows quickly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "~/Library/Logs/Sevoflurane-wine.log 始终会记录错误。此设置还会记录每次异常和库加载，因此日志会迅速增大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 % low" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1% 低帧率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 GB for 32-bit games" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为 32 位游戏提供 4 GB 内存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8 · 6 · 4" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8 · 6 · 4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 months" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12 个月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "14-day trial" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "14 天试用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 32-bit game may use 4 GB where Windows would give it 2." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "32 位游戏可使用 4 GB 内存，而 Windows 通常只提供 2 GB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 32-bit program can address 4 GB, and Windows gives it the lower 2 GB unless its file carries the Large Address Aware flag. Modded and texture-heavy 32-bit games run out of those 2 GB and crash. With this on every 32-bit game gets all 4, flag or no flag." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "32 位程序最多可寻址 4 GB；除非文件带有“大地址感知”标志，否则 Windows 只提供低位的 2 GB。经过修改或使用大量纹理的 32 位游戏可能用尽这 2 GB 并崩溃。开启后，所有 32 位游戏都可使用完整的 4 GB，无论是否带有该标志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bottle named “%@” already exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存在名为“%@”的容器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A change applies the same way. Reset restores the engine's own version." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更改的生效方式相同。重设会恢复引擎自带的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A command-line tool, and the way AI assistants reach Steam through MCP. Asks for an administrator password." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装命令行工具，让 AI 助手通过 MCP 使用 Steam。安装时需要管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dormison-b<N>.tar.xz you downloaded, or an engine folder you built. Sevoflurane checks the .sig beside a tarball." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可选择已下载的 dormison-b<N>.tar.xz，或自行构建的引擎文件夹。Sevoflurane 会验证压缩包旁的 .sig 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few old games assume addresses stay under 2 GB and crash above it: turn it off for that game." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "少数旧游戏假定地址不会超过 2 GB，超过后可能崩溃；请为这类游戏关闭此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一款游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a game data folder beside it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "旁边有游戏数据文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game draws at the size it chose. A resizable window scales that picture to the window through the upscaler, and the game keeps believing in its own size." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏按自己选择的尺寸绘制画面。可调整大小的窗口通过画面缩放器将画面适配到窗口，而游戏仍以为自己使用的是原尺寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game is around 100 GB and each voice-over another 12 to 15 GB. An install that stops, or is stopped, carries on from where it was when you install into the same folder again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每款游戏约 100 GB，每种语音包另需 12 至 15 GB。安装中断或被停止后，再次安装到同一文件夹时会从中断处继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game says a file is missing and will not start." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏提示缺少文件，无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game shows a black screen where its intro video plays." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏播放片头视频时出现黑屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game shows a black screen, or stops while its shaders compile." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏出现黑屏，或在编译着色器时卡住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game starts and its picture is wrong, flickers or stays black." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏可以启动，但画面异常、闪烁或持续黑屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game that picks a slower AVX code path because it is offered can run better with this off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果游戏因检测到 AVX 而选择较慢的代码路径，关闭此选项可能使游戏运行得更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game that switches the screen's resolution gets a window instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尝试切换屏幕分辨率的游戏会改为在窗口中运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game's library and store pages say how it runs on a Mac, whether it has a macOS version, and what its anti-cheat does. Sevoflurane's own players' runs come first where there are enough." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏的库页面和商店页面会显示它在 Mac 上的运行情况、是否有 macOS 版本，以及其反作弊的情况。在数据足够时，优先采用 Sevoflurane 玩家自己的运行记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game's page says how it runs on a Mac and what its anti-cheat does, in the slot Steam's own Deck strip leaves empty here." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏页面会在 Steam Deck 兼容性信息下方显示该游戏在 Mac 上的运行情况，以及反作弊功能是否可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game's threads hand work to each other thousands of times a second. Putting a thread to sleep and waking it costs far more on macOS than on Windows, so a thread can spin briefly first in case its wake-up is about to arrive." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏线程每秒会交换任务数千次。在 macOS 上，让线程休眠再唤醒的开销远高于 Windows。因此线程可以先短暂自旋等待，看看任务是否即将到来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A launcher shows empty buttons, or text is boxes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动器的按钮没有文字，或文字显示为方框。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A level reaches each game the next time it is launched. Debug mode restarts Steam, and ends when Sevoflurane quits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "诊断级别会在游戏下次启动时生效。调试模式会重新启动 Steam，并在退出 Sevoflurane 时结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link shares another bottle's copy of a game. One copy on disk, no second download. Steam verifies it on first launch. Each bottle keeps its own saves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "链接可共享其他容器中的游戏文件，无需再次下载。Steam 会在首次启动时验证文件。每个容器仍保留各自的存档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Mac has one pool of memory that the processor and the graphics chip both use. Windows games expect a separate graphics card, so they copy every texture twice: once to hand it over, once to store it. On a Mac both copies land in the same memory." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 的处理器和图形芯片共用同一组内存。Windows 游戏预期使用独立显卡，因此会将每个纹理复制两次：一次用于传输，一次用于存储。在 Mac 上，两份副本都落在同一内存中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mod, a fix or a loader is installed and the game ignores it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装模组、修补程序或加载器，但游戏没有使用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A monogram of the display name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由显示名称首字母生成的图案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new bottle gets the fonts and legacy runtimes too, not the required ones alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新容器除了必需组件，还会安装字体和旧版运行库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer Dormison than any installed here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有比已安装版本更新的 Dormison。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real run signs in with your Apple Account and downloads the toolkit. This one loads nothing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正常使用时，此处会登录 Apple 账户并下载工具包。此演示不会加载任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A report was collected and nothing in it names an error." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已收集报告，其中没有发现明确的错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A resizable window scales the game's picture to fit." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可调整大小的窗口会缩放游戏画面，使其适合窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Retina display has four pixels for every point macOS lays out. Windows programs are told the point size by default, and the picture is scaled up." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retina 显示器的每个 macOS 布局点对应四个像素。默认情况下，Windows 程序只会看到以点计算的尺寸，画面再被放大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second try keeps what already downloaded." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试时会保留已下载的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A thread spins for about two microseconds first, and stops doing so where that keeps failing. Hand-offs get up to ten times quicker; a game with more busy threads than the Mac has cores pays in processor time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线程先自旋约两微秒；如果持续未等到任务，就停止自旋。任务交接速度最高可提高十倍；如果忙碌线程多于 Mac 的核心数，则会增加处理器开销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A waiting thread sleeps at once, as Wine does it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待中的线程会像 Wine 的默认行为一样立即休眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a window the game locks to one size gets a resize handle and its picture scales; a full-screen game stays full screen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定尺寸的游戏窗口会获得调整大小的控点，画面随窗口缩放；全屏游戏仍保持全屏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A window the game locks to one size gets a resize handle, and its picture scales to fit. A full-screen game stays full screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定尺寸的游戏窗口会获得调整大小的控点，画面随窗口缩放。全屏游戏仍保持全屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Windows program" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 程序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Wine engine runs Windows games on your Mac." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wine 引擎可让 Windows 游戏在 Mac 上运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Sevoflurane" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于 Sevoflurane"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Acknowledgments" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "致谢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Folder…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a library in Steam’s settings, under Storage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Steam 的“设置 › 存储空间”中添加游戏库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add and Play" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加并开始游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Existing Folder…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加现有文件夹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add from a Disk Image…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从磁盘映像添加…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add from Folder or Archive…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从文件夹或压缩包添加…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Quick Launch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加到快速启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Windows Game…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加 Windows 游戏…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在添加 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address width" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds every library a game loads, whole crash dumps, a doctor report and the machine's state while it runs. Turns itself off after the next game." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "额外记录游戏加载的每个库、完整崩溃转储、检查报告，以及运行期间的 Mac 状态。下次游戏运行结束后会自动关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds support for DirectX 12 games." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加对 DirectX 12 游戏的支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds Wine's exception channel, each renderer's own log, and a report after every run. Turn this on before reproducing a bug." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "额外记录 Wine 异常和各渲染器日志，并在每次运行后生成报告。请在重现问题前开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a game closes, its frame rate, resolution, engine and settings go to the public Sevoflurane game database with your Mac’s model and chip. Nothing names you, your Mac or your account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏关闭后，帧率、分辨率、引擎、设置以及 Mac 机型和芯片信息会发送到公开的 Sevoflurane 游戏数据库。这些信息不包含你的姓名、Mac 名称或账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a game closes, Sevoflurane sends its frame rate, resolution, engine and settings, with your Mac’s model and chip. Nothing names you, your Mac or your account." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏关闭后，Sevoflurane 会发送帧率、分辨率、引擎、设置以及 Mac 机型和芯片信息。这些信息不包含你的姓名、Mac 名称或账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the game loads, play for at least a minute in an area you can return to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏加载完成后，请在可再次到达的区域游玩至少一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI assistants (MCP)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 助手 (MCP)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow each assistant to control Steam through MCP." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许每个助手通过 MCP 控制 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Notifications" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Sevoflurane notifications in System Settings to see Steam messages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“系统设置”中允许 Sevoflurane 发送通知，以查看 Steam 消息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Sevoflurane to show Steam messages in Notification Center." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 Sevoflurane 在通知中心显示 Steam 消息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already have the disk image?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已有磁盘映像？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also in the menu bar popover, under the … button." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也可以通过菜单栏弹出窗口中的“…”按钮开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also, a full-screen game plays in a window you can move and resize, and still draws as if it filled the screen. Pick this to play a full-screen game in a window." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全屏游戏也可以在可移动、可调整大小的窗口中运行，但仍按全屏尺寸绘制画面。如果想在窗口中玩全屏游戏，请选择此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always run with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "始终使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An empty bottle with a fresh Steam." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创建新容器并安装 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "an Engine folder beside it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "旁边有 Engine 文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An RPG Maker MV game on NW.js: the native macOS runtime runs it outside the bottle, with its achievements carried by a stub." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
