    "Apple's sign-in page appears here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 登录页面会显示在这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to every program in this bottle starting with the next game launch. winecfg shows the same values; Settings › Games has per-game overrides." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从下次启动游戏起，此设置适用于该容器中的所有程序。winecfg 会显示相同的值；“设置 › 游戏”中可为单个游戏指定覆盖设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies while a game has taken the pointer, as a first-person camera does. Menus and the desktop keep the Mac's pointer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏占用指针时生效，例如使用第一人称视角时。菜单和桌面仍使用 Mac 指针。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "as fixed, and a full-screen game plays in a window you can move and resize, still drawing as if it filled the screen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除固定尺寸窗口外，全屏游戏也会在可移动、可调整大小的窗口中运行，但仍按全屏尺寸绘制"
