            "value" : "正在下载引擎（约 %lld MB）…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloading the Steam installer…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在下载 Steam 安装程序…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "downloading VC++ (%@)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在下载 VC++（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads, controllers, and the Steam interface." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载、控制器和 Steam 界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draws every frame of the last five seconds at the time it took, so a hitch shows as a spike the average hides. The 1 % low is the frame rate of the slowest one in a hundred frames of the last ten seconds." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按每帧耗时绘制最近五秒的帧。卡顿会显示为尖峰，即使平均值没有变化。1% 最低帧率指最近十秒中最慢的 1% 帧所对应的帧率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "driver" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "驱动程序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During mouse-look the pointer stays off your other displays." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼠标视角控制期间，指针不会移到其他显示器上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DXMT dropped compute work. A shader failed to convert to Metal, so the pass never ran. Expect a black screen or a missing effect." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DXMT 跳过了计算任务。着色器转换为 Metal 时失败，因此该渲染步骤没有运行。画面可能变黑或缺少特效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DXMT refuses three Direct3D 11 feature queries with E_INVALIDARG. They cover instancing, markers, and D3D9 options. Callers read the answer as a no, so the effect is cosmetic." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DXMT 对三个 Direct3D 11 功能查询返回 E_INVALIDARG，涉及实例化、标记和 D3D9 选项。游戏会将结果视为不支持，通常只影响显示效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DXSETUP failed (%@)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DXSETUP 失败（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each bottle has its own Steam installation, games, and settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个容器都有独立的 Steam 安装、游戏和设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each game launches as its own app. When it fills the screen, macOS engages Game Mode on its own. Nothing to toggle." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每款游戏都作为独立 App 启动。进入全屏后，macOS 会自动启用游戏模式，无需手动设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each game's run is recorded, and a crash collects its reports. Nothing measurable is spent." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录每次游戏运行，崩溃时收集报告。不会产生可测量的性能开销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each iteration takes about 0.4 ns. 5200 iterations take two microseconds; 0 disables spinning." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次迭代约需 0.4 纳秒。5200 次迭代约需 2 微秒；设为 0 可关闭自旋等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each report holds the run's record, Wine's exception trail, the game's own crash logs and Steam's, with paths, account names and Steam ids taken out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每份报告包含运行记录、Wine 异常记录、游戏崩溃日志和 Steam 日志，其中的路径、账号名称和 Steam ID 均已移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End Game" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结束游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ended by the user while it was not responding" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
