    "Enhanced sync (msync+)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增强同步（msync+）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enhanced synchronization (msync)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增强同步（msync）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enhanced synchronization (msync+)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增强同步（msync+）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enlarges the picture with a shader made for it: Anime4K and CuNNy for drawn art, by whole steps such as 2×, and MetalFX Spatial for 3D games. Off hands the picture to macOS, which stretches it softly. Final filter only uses no shader." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用专门的着色器放大画面：Anime4K 和 CuNNy 适用于手绘风格画面，按 2 倍等整数倍放大；MetalFX Spatial 适用于 3D 游戏。关闭后，macOS 会柔和地拉伸画面。最终滤镜仅适用于未使用着色器的画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every file checks out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有文件均完好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every game is a real Mac window. Fixed-size games, even old ones that never allowed it, become resizable and go native full screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每款游戏都以独立的 Mac 窗口运行。即使游戏原本不支持调整窗口大小，也可以缩放窗口并进入原生全屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every game you launch appears here. See Settings › Diagnostics for how to record a useful run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你启动的每个游戏都会显示在这里。请参阅“设置 › 诊断”，了解如何记录有用的运行信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every game you run gets one. Nothing collected yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你运行的每个游戏都会生成一份。尚未收集任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every library a game loads, the renderer's own errors in a file of their own, and how each frame reached the screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录游戏加载的所有库、单独保存的渲染器错误，以及每一帧的显示过程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every one of these is enforced as it is written: the oldest goes first, and nothing here can grow without a bound." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有存储限制都会生效。达到上限时，最旧的数据会先被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every window stays as the game makes it, and a full-screen game covers the screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个窗口都保持游戏设定的样子。全屏游戏会覆盖整个屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "every window stays as the game makes it; a full-screen game covers the screen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个窗口都保持游戏设定的样子；全屏游戏会覆盖整个屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every window with a title bar" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有带标题栏的窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "every window with a title bar can be resized and its picture scales, windows the game resizes itself included; a full-screen game stays full screen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有带标题栏的窗口都可调整大小，画面随之缩放，包括游戏原本可调整的窗口；全屏游戏仍保持全屏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every window with a title bar can be resized, the ones a game already lets you resize included: such a game keeps its size and is scaled like the rest, rather than redrawing at the new size. A full-screen game stays full screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有带标题栏的窗口都可调整大小，包括游戏原本允许调整的窗口。这些游戏会保持原来的绘制尺寸，再将画面缩放到新尺寸，而不会按新尺寸重新绘制。全屏游戏仍保持全屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Windows process in the bottle stops, Wine's server included, then Steam reopens. Slower than restarting Steam alone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "容器中的所有 Windows 进程（包括 Wine 服务）都会停止，然后 Steam 会重新启动。这比单独重启 Steam 更慢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything keeps a readable size, and the upscaler sharpens the result." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有内容都会保持易读的尺寸，画面缩放器会锐化结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
