    "games" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games appear here after their first launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏首次启动后会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games built this way start one worker per processor, and under Rosetta the workers never rest, which starves the picture. Telling the game it has %lld processors lets them sleep." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这类游戏会为每个处理器启动一个工作线程，而在 Rosetta 下这些线程从不休息，画面因此得不到算力。告诉游戏它只有 %lld 个处理器，工作线程就能休眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games in Discord's database show as what you play." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Discord 数据库中的游戏会显示为你正在玩的游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games run through Dormison, Sevoflurane’s own build of Wine with DirectX 12 support and fixes for the games themselves." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏通过 Dormison 运行。它是 Sevoflurane 自带的 Wine 版本，支持 DirectX 12，并包含针对游戏的修复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games see every pixel, so a 5K display offers 5120 × 2880 in a game's resolution list. A program written before high-DPI displays draws its text, buttons and launcher at half the size." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏会看到每个像素，因此 5K 显示器会在游戏的分辨率列表中提供 5120 × 2880。为高 DPI 显示器普及前编写的程序会将文字、按钮和启动器绘制成一半大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games see the display's real pixel count. Older games draw tiny text and menus." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏会看到显示器的实际像素数。较早的游戏可能显示很小的文字和菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games that check for AVX at launch find it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏启动时检查 AVX 即可检测到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games using this upscaler fall back to Lanczos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用此画面缩放器的游戏会改用 Lanczos。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games with their own Discord support show their status. Restart Steam to apply a change." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自带 Discord 支持的游戏会显示其状态。更改后请重新启动 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gathering the logs…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在收集日志…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Genshin holds itself to 60 fps. An unlocker such as unlockfps_nc.exe raises the cap: Sevoflurane starts it beside the game 30 seconds after the game's process appears, in the same Windows, and points its fps_config.json at the game. It changes the running game's memory, which HoYoverse's terms do not allow, so the choice is yours." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原神将帧率限制在 60 fps。unlockfps_nc.exe 等解锁器可以提高上限：游戏进程出现 30 秒后，Sevoflurane 会在同一个 Windows 环境中启动它，并将其 fps_config.json 指向该游戏。它会修改运行中游戏的内存，这违反 HoYoverse 的条款，因此是否使用由你决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Genshin holds itself to 60 fps. Sevoflurane's engine carries an unlocker (genshin-fps-unlock's, MIT); switched on, it starts beside the game 30 seconds after the game's process appears. Choose another, such as unlockfps_nc.exe, to use that one instead. An unlocker changes the running game's memory, which HoYoverse's terms do not allow, so the switch is yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原神将帧率限制在 60 fps。Sevoflurane 的引擎自带一个解锁器（来自 genshin-fps-unlock，MIT 许可）；开启后，它会在游戏进程出现 30 秒后随游戏一起启动。也可以选择其他解锁器（例如 unlockfps_nc.exe）来代替它。解锁器会修改运行中游戏的内存，这违反 HoYoverse 的条款，因此是否开启由你决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
