          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides your Steam name, picture, wallet balance and friends in every Steam window, for recording and streaming." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在所有 Steam 窗口中隐藏你的 Steam 名称、头像、钱包余额和好友，便于录屏和直播。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High-resolution mode" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高分辨率模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How did it go?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行得怎么样？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How did it go? Sending also tells other Mac players, with the configuration below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行得怎么样？发送后，其他 Mac 玩家也会看到你的反馈及以下配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it differs from the level" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与诊断级别的区别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a game's threads look for work before they sleep." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏线程休眠前查找任务的时长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many processors a game is told the Mac has. Games built on Unity 5 start a worker thread for each one, and under Rosetta every worker keeps looking for work instead of sleeping, so a Mac with many cores spends them all on waiting." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告诉游戏这台 Mac 有多少个处理器。基于 Unity 5 的游戏为每个处理器启动一个工作线程，而在 Rosetta 下每个工作线程都在不停寻找任务而不休眠，因此核心越多的 Mac 越是把它们全部耗在等待上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much a run records" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行记录的详细程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "idle" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "闲置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a game misbehaves" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果游戏运行异常"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In “%@” · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "In “%1$@” · %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“%1$@”中 · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Engine settings, choose an engine that includes D3DMetal. Downloaded toolkits stay installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“引擎”设置中选择包含 D3DMetal 的引擎。已下载的工具包会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Terminal, sevo diag --help shows these steps. Use sevo perf compare to measure a setting's effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“终端”中，sevo diag --help 会显示这些步骤。使用 sevo perf compare 测量设置的效果。"
