          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已安装 %@。请选择要保留的程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It tried to load %@, a Windows kernel driver, usually kernel-level anti-cheat, and kernel drivers cannot run on a Mac. If the program requires it, that is why it stopped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它尝试加载 Windows 内核驱动程序 %@（通常是内核级反作弊组件），而内核驱动程序无法在 Mac 上运行。如果该程序需要这个驱动程序，这就是它停止的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its dependencies and Windows settings are CrossOver's to change." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此容器的依赖项和 Windows 设置由 CrossOver 管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
