    "Nothing counted this run's frames. A game with no Metal layer has no counter, and the driver's counter reaches records from the engine that carries it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次运行没有帧率数据。未使用 Metal 图层的游戏没有帧率计数器，驱动程序的计数器也仅支持搭载它的引擎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
