      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Old games render small. Sevoflurane can upscale the picture past the game’s own resolution, with filters for 3D games and for 2D anime art." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "旧游戏的画面分辨率通常较低。Sevoflurane 可以将画面放大到超过游戏本身的分辨率，并为 3D 游戏和 2D 动漫风格画面提供滤镜。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older games ask Windows to switch the display to 800 × 600 or 1024 × 768 and draw full screen. A Mac display has no such modes. With this on the game is told the switch happened, and its picture goes into a window that the upscaler scales." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "较早的游戏会要求 Windows 切换到 800 × 600 或 1024 × 768 并全屏绘制。Mac 显示器没有这些模式。开启后，游戏会收到切换成功的反馈，画面则显示在由画面缩放器调整的窗口中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On P-cores" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "P 核占比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "one core at 100 %" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单个核心占用 100%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One number at the top right of the game's window." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在游戏窗口右上角显示一个数字。"
