    "Sign in on Apple’s page and download “Evaluation environment for Windows games”, the small file with D3DMetal in it. The Game Porting Toolkit works too. Sevoflurane installs it the moment it lands." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在 Apple 网页上登录，下载包含 D3DMetal 的“Evaluation environment for Windows games”。也可下载 Game Porting Toolkit。文件下载完成后，Sevoflurane 会立即安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign In to Steam" : {
