    "Steam" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam and anything running in it close when Sevoflurane quits. For Steam problems, use the ⋯ menu to restart or open Recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退出 Sevoflurane 时，Steam 及其中运行的所有程序也会关闭。如果 Steam 出现问题，请通过“⋯”菜单重新启动或打开“恢复”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam cannot start until this is fixed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解决此问题后才能启动 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam closes and installs in %@. Your current bottle and games stay." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 将关闭，并在 %@ 中安装。当前容器和游戏会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam closes at once and reopens clean. A running game keeps playing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 会立即关闭并重新启动。正在运行的游戏不会中断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam closes, prepares %@, then reopens there." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 将关闭，在 %@ 中完成准备，然后重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam closes. Sevoflurane removes the engines and toolkits it downloaded, resets its settings, and disconnects assistants.\n\nKeep Games leaves Steam and its %@ of files in place. Uninstall Everything moves those files to the Trash, local saves included.\n\nSevoflurane moves itself to the Trash and quits. Your Steam account and cloud saves stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 会关闭。Sevoflurane 会移除已下载的引擎和工具包，重设设置，并断开与助手的连接。\n\n选择“卸载并保留游戏”会保留 Steam 及其 %@ 的文件。选择“全部卸载”会将这些文件移到废纸篓，包括本地存档。\n\nSevoflurane 会将自身移到废纸篓并退出。你的 Steam 账户和云存档会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam could not be stopped, so setup kept the bottle it had. Try again, or quit Steam from the menu bar first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法停止 Steam，因此设置保留了原有容器。请重试，或先从菜单栏退出 Steam。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a message" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 有一条消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
