    "Streamer Mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主播模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subnautica 2 renders with Direct3D 12, and D3DMetal is the only layer here that answers it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subnautica 2 使用 Direct3D 12 渲染，在这里需要 D3DMetal 才能运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在切换…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synchronizing with Steam Cloud" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在与 Steam 云同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell other Mac players how this game ran on this configuration. The verdict, the note and the configuration below go to the public game database; the note is the only part you write." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告诉其他 Mac 玩家这款游戏在此配置下的运行情况。评价、备注和以下配置会发送到公开的游戏数据库；只有备注由你填写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not a picture Sevoflurane can read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sevoflurane 无法读取该文件中的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background helper had given up on Steam. Steam is restarting." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台辅助程序已停止尝试启动 Steam。Steam 正在重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background helper is already healthy." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台辅助程序运行正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background helper is running." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台辅助程序正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The counter with the last five seconds of frames and the 1 % low." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示帧率计数器，以及最近五秒的帧时间和 1% 最低帧率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The CrossOver %@ trial on this Mac has ended. License it at codeweavers.com, or use Dormison." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上的 CrossOver %@ 试用期已结束。请前往 codeweavers.com 购买许可证，或使用 Dormison。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The database deletes these runs. The next run you share uses a new, unrelated identity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据库会删除这些运行记录。下次共享的运行记录会使用一个全新且无关联的身份标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The database is unavailable. Try again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据库暂时不可用。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The database refused it: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据库拒绝了此报告：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine also installs from a file: dormison-b<N>.tar.xz and its .sig, from the Dormison release." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也可从 Dormison 发布页下载 dormison-b<N>.tar.xz 及其 .sig 文件来安装引擎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's built-in version is used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将使用引擎自带的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder the game's .exe is in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏 .exe 所在的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fonts and legacy runtimes games ask for." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装游戏所需的字体和旧版运行库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is NW.js: the native macOS runtime runs it outside the bottle, at the speed of a Mac browser rather than of Rosetta." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这款游戏基于 NW.js。macOS 原生运行时可在容器外运行它，速度接近 Mac 浏览器，无需通过 Rosetta。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is told the truth (Direct3D 12 calls it UMA) and writes each texture once. Games that stream large scenes gain the most." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告知游戏实际的内存架构（Direct3D 12 称为 UMA），让每个纹理只写入一次。持续载入大型场景的游戏受益最大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game sees every processor, as it would on Windows." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏能看到全部处理器，与在 Windows 上相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game sees that many and starts that many workers. A game that uses most of the processor time and still stutters runs smoother with fewer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏只看到这么多处理器，也只启动这么多工作线程。占用大部分处理器时间却仍然卡顿的游戏，处理器更少时会更流畅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper keeps Steam supervised even when this app is closed. Rebuilding it registers it fresh; approve it in Login Items if asked." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使 Sevoflurane 已关闭，后台辅助程序仍会监控 Steam。重建会重新注册辅助程序；如果系统提示，请在“登录项”中允许它运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer did not start." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装程序未能启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last attempt stopped: %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次尝试已停止：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The level is kept and costs little. Debug mode costs speed and disk, so it lives only as long as this session." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "诊断级别会保留，资源开销较低。调试模式会占用性能和磁盘空间，因此仅在本次会话中生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library is not loaded at all." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全不加载此库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limit takes effect the next time the game starts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "限制将在游戏下次启动时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the Mac is hot%@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 温度过高%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the Mac is hot%@ and macOS is slowing it down" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 温度过高%@，macOS 正在降低运行速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar says the background helper won't start." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏提示后台辅助程序无法启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mouse's own movement, unshaped: the same sweep of the hand turns the camera the same amount at any speed. What shooters expect." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直接使用鼠标移动距离：无论移动速度如何，相同的手部位移都会让视角转动相同幅度。这是射击游戏通常需要的方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note has characters that are not plain text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备注包含非纯文本字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note is over %lld characters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备注超过 %lld 个字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note names a file path. Reports are public, so paths stay out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备注中包含文件路径。报告是公开的，因此不能包含路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note names an e-mail address. Reports are public, so addresses stay out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备注中包含电子邮件地址。报告是公开的，因此不能包含地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pointer's usual curve: a fast flick travels farther than a slow sweep of the same length." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "采用指针的常规加速曲线：快速甩动比相同距离的慢速移动走得更远。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the redistributable refused to extract" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行库无法解压"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be sent: %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法发送报告：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report could not be written: %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入报告：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report was compressed at level 2." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告已使用级别 2 压缩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The report was not accepted. %@ is kept in Finder for you to send another way." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告未被接收。%@ 已保留在访达中，你可以通过其他方式发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the Steam client carries this value, so it restarts (about 30 s) around the next launch" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此值由 Steam 客户端使用，因此 Steam 会在下次启动游戏前后重新启动（约 30 秒）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Unity game quit with status 1 and never drew a window. It failed during start-up, in its graphics device or in Mono." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unity 游戏以状态码 1 退出，且从未显示窗口。它在启动期间于图形设备或 Mono 中出错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window system scales the picture." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "窗口系统会缩放画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the zip" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该压缩包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The zip holds this run's record, the app's and Wine's logs, the game's own crash logs, Steam's logs and a doctor report. Paths, account names, Steam ids and persona names are taken out of every one of them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "压缩包包含本次运行记录、App 和 Wine 日志、游戏崩溃日志、Steam 日志及诊断报告。所有文件中的路径、账号名称、Steam ID 和个人资料名称均已移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are Wine's own overrides, the values winecfg's Libraries tab shows and edits: a game's are stored under its program, the bottle's under every program. The renderer's libraries (d3d9 to d3d12, dxgi) follow the Renderer setting, which wins." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是 Wine 自身的覆盖设置，也是 winecfg“函数库”标签页显示和编辑的值：单个游戏的设置存储在其程序下，容器设置适用于所有程序。渲染器库（d3d9 至 d3d12、dxgi）由优先级更高的“渲染器”设置决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files come with Windows runtimes that games expect to be there. Install Visual C++ runtime for VCRUNTIME and MSVCP, DirectX runtimes for d3dx9, xinput and xaudio, in Settings › Engine › Game dependencies." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些文件来自游戏所需的 Windows 运行库。请前往“设置”>“引擎”>“游戏依赖项”，为 VCRUNTIME 和 MSVCP 安装 Visual C++ 运行库，并为 d3dx9、xinput 和 xaudio 安装 DirectX 运行库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These renderers translate Direct3D for macOS. Try another if a game looks wrong." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些渲染器会将 Direct3D 转换为 macOS 图形调用。如果游戏画面异常，请尝试其他渲染器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This drive is %@. Games here can fail to install, update or start. Reformat it as APFS, or move the games to another library in Steam." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此磁盘的格式为 %@。游戏可能无法在这里安装、更新或启动。请将磁盘重新格式化为 APFS，或在 Steam 中将游戏移到其他游戏库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This game has held exactly one core for over a minute. A game at rest on a menu should use far less: it is usually a busy loop in the game, and sometimes a sign that something it waits for never arrives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此游戏已持续占满一个核心超过一分钟。停留在菜单中的游戏本应占用少得多：这通常是游戏中的忙等待循环，有时也表示它在等待的东西始终没有到达。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This library is on a %@ network share. Updates and saves are slow and can fail there." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此游戏库位于 %@ 网络共享位置。更新和存档可能很慢，也可能失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This package is missing. Games fall back to Lanczos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此组件包缺失。游戏会改用 Lanczos。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thread waiting" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线程等待"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To test a setting, change one value at a time and play the same area twice with each value." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试设置时，每次只更改一个值，并使用每个值在同一区域各玩两次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trashes Steam's shader cache so it rebuilds on the next launch. For a black screen or a stuck loading bar. Your games and saves stay." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Steam 的着色器缓存移到废纸篓，下次启动时会重新生成。适用于黑屏或加载进度卡住的情况。游戏和存档会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "试用版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial ended" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "试用期已结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Troubleshooting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "故障排除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try another renderer in Settings › Games › the game › Renderer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置”>“游戏”>对应游戏>“渲染器”中尝试其他渲染器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Share run statistics in Settings › General › Community to send a report about this run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“设置 › 通用 › 社区”中开启“共享运行统计数据”，以发送此次运行的报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two steps, in order, between the game's picture and the window." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏画面进入窗口前依次经过两个步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo the link" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "撤销关联"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unified memory" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "统一内存"
          }
        }
      }
