    "Unity 5 starts a worker per processor and keeps every one spinning under Rosetta: on a 16-core M4 Max the game used 1357 % CPU at 54 fps, stalling several times a second, and told of 8 processors, 184 % at 117 fps." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unity 5 为每个处理器启动一个工作线程，在 Rosetta 下它们全都在空转：在 16 核的 M4 Max 上，游戏占用 1357 % CPU，帧率 54 fps，每秒卡顿数次；告诉它只有 8 个处理器后，CPU 为 184 %，帧率 117 fps。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
