    "Wait spin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待自旋"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait spin and Object spin count loop iterations of about 0.4 ns each: 5200 is two microseconds, 0 is off. Wait spin covers a thread waiting on anything; Object spin covers a contended lock, event or semaphore. Back off stops the spinning on waits that keep missing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“等待自旋”和“对象自旋”以循环次数计数，每次迭代约需 0.4 纳秒：5200 次约为两微秒，0 表示关闭。“等待自旋”适用于线程等待任何任务；“对象自旋”适用于争用的锁、事件或信号量。若等待持续未命中，退避会停止自旋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
