    "Wine ships its own version of most Windows libraries and prefers it. An override changes that for one library." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wine 自带大多数 Windows 库的版本，并优先使用自带版本。覆盖设置可改变某个库的加载顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine uses its own copy of a library it knows. Add a DLL override for that file in Settings › Games, set to Native, then built-in, so the game's copy wins." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wine 可能优先使用自带的同名库。请前往“设置”>“游戏”，为该文件添加 DLL 覆盖，并设为“原生，然后内建”，以优先使用游戏中的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine's built-in Direct3D renderer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wine 内建的 Direct3D 渲染器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine's built-in renderer. Try it when the others fail." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wine 内建渲染器。其他渲染器无法使用时可尝试此项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine's copy first. Wine's usual order." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "优先使用 Wine 的版本。这是 Wine 的默认顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without faked mode changes the game is offered the display's 16:9 modes alone; with them win32u adds 26 virtual modes, the 4:3 ones this game looks for included." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启模拟显示模式切换后，win32u 会增加 26 种虚拟分辨率，包括这款游戏需要的 4:3 模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "working…" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在处理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在写入…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong textures, or a game that stops at launch: turn it off for that game. Few games are tested on this path." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果纹理显示错误或游戏启动时卡住，请为该游戏关闭此选项。经此路径测试的游戏很少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrote %@ to the Desktop. The manifest is on the clipboard." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已将 %@ 保存到桌面。文件清单已复制到剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrote %lld sources to %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已将 %lld 项数据写入 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can stop, or delete what you shared, in Settings › General." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在“设置 › 通用”中停止共享，或删除已共享的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your games and saves stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏和存档会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library is in the menu bar under %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "游戏库位于菜单栏中的 %@ 下。"
